title: Fritz Baade
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, nonfactional
card-image: img/portraits/BaadeFritz.jpg
view-if: baade_advisor = 1
new-page: true 

= Fritz Baade

Baade is [? if chancellor = "Baade": the current Chancellor and ?] [? if president = "Baade": the current President and ?] one of the few agricultural experts in the SPD, and an unorthodox economist.

- @agriculture
- @rural_campaign
- @depression
- @chancellor
- @president
- @root: Return to main

@agriculture
title: Agricultural Policy
subtitle: Baade is the Minister of Agriculture.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and spd_in_government and agriculture_minister_party == "SPD"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_in_government : The SPD is not in government. ?][? if agriculture_minister_party != "SPD": The SPD does not have the Agriculture Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; agricultural_policy_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: agricultural_policy


@rural_campaign
title: Rural Campaign
subtitle: Try to campaign among the rural populace.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and rural_policy > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if rural_policy == 0 : We have not enacted any rural policies. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; rural_spd += 5*(1-dissent); peoples_party_support += 1

We have increased our campaigning among farmers and the rural populace.

@depression
title: Addressing the economic crisis
subtitle: Formulate a plan to rescue us from the economic crisis.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and wtb_adopted = 0 and black_thursday_seen
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if black_thursday_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?][? if wtb_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted the WTB-Plan. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; wtb_support += 2; center_dissent += 10; labor_strength += 1

The WTB-Plan, standing for its primary supporters Woytinsky, Tarnow, and Baade, has been adopted as the unions' plan for getting us out of the depression. Baade canvasses in favor of this plan throughout the party.

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Baade can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Baade"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Baade can make use of their position to further our goals.
view if: president == "Baade"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]

- @article_48: We can use Article 48!
- @military_relations: We can improve our relations with the Reichswehr.
- @on_the_world_stage: We can improve our relations on the world stage.
- @presidential_snap_election: We can call snap elections!
- @reichsexecution: We can order a Reichsexekution!

@article_48
choose-if: chancellor_party == "SPD" and not presidential_powers and article_48_timer <= 8 and judicial_reform >= 3 and ((neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed >= 50) or in_emergency_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The reactionary judiciary would strike them down as unconstitutional. ?][? if neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed < 50 : The party views these decrees as unecessary. ?][? if article_48_timer > 8 : [+ article_48_timer +] months before we can next take this action. ?]
go-to: article_48

@military_relations
view-if: not victory_republic
choose-if: military_relations_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ military_relations_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: military_relations

@on_the_world_stage
choose-if: on_the_world_stage_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ on_the_world_stage_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: on_the_world_stage

